        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with a quiet room. A television flickers. An apartment door creaks open. Something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous author Janus Brennhart is giving an interview right after his latest book. The interview takes him to old days and stories some of which he doesn’t recall now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Remains and The Residue</i> is short atmospheric puzzle-adventure game that invites players to explore stories and memories of the famous author Janus Brennhart. Through fragmented stories, you’ll piece together a narrative where fiction seems to bleed into the real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich adventure with different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay, about 1-2 hours</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with a quiet room. A television flickers. An apartment door creaks open. Something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous author Janus Brennhart is giving an interview right after his latest book. The interview takes him to old days and stories some of which he doesn’t recall now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Remains and The Residue</i> is short atmospheric puzzle-adventure game that invites players to explore stories and memories of the famous author Janus Brennhart. Through fragmented stories, you’ll piece together a narrative where fiction seems to bleed into the real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich adventure with different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay, about 1-2 hours</p></li></ul>",
